# Validation Rules

## Shared Package
- All request/response validation schemas live in `packages/shared/src/schemas/`
- Export types via `z.infer<typeof schema>`
- Constants (limits, routes, socket events) in `constants.ts`

## Content Limits (enforce in schemas)
| Field | Min | Max |
|-------|-----|-----|
| Thread title | 10 | 200 |
| Thread body | 50 | 20,000 |
| Tags per thread | 1 | 5 |
| Username | 3 | 30 (`a-z0-9_`) |
| Community slug | 3 | 50 (`a-z0-9-`) |

## Tag Rules
- Tags must be valid UUIDs referencing existing tags OR created by moderators
- Display slug: lowercase, hyphens only
- Blocklist enforced server-side for spam slugs

## When Adding Schemas
1. Add Zod schema in `packages/shared`
2. Export from `index.ts`
3. Use in API handler + frontend form
4. Update `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md` if new domain entity
